<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Zutto Zutto Zutto"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Ryokuoushoku Shakai"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Zutto Zutto Zutto - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU902101238"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1568447034"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">全都是绝不能忘记的事</text><text for="L2">无论是抱恙还是安康</text><text for="L3">每当风吹过总会想起</text><text for="L4">铭记在心 咽下所有 继续前行</text><text for="L5">都说人生只有这么一遭</text><text for="L6">抱歉啊 我其实还没什么实感</text><text for="L7">只是心底怎么也不甘心</text><text for="L8">我明明还能做到更多</text><text for="L9">分明没有标准答案 却总苦苦追寻</text><text for="L10">同样的今天绝不会再次重来</text><text for="L11">明明心里都懂 却为何悔恨 为何落泪？</text><text for="L12">瞧 若你已开始眷恋明天 那就欣然欢喜吧</text><text for="L13">全都是无法彻底割舍的事</text><text for="L14">珍视之物一定要好好珍惜</text><text for="L15">是那一天的自己教会了我</text><text for="L16">就连落下的泪滴 也要一一去兑现</text><text for="L17">尽是些绝不能忘记的事</text><text for="L18">无论身处逆境还是安康</text><text for="L19">每当微风拂过总会忆起</text><text for="L20">铭记在心 咽下所有 坚定走下去</text><text for="L21">一直 一直 走下去</text><text for="L22">全人类都不过是人之子啊</text><text for="L23">无关乎所谓的大人还是小孩</text><text for="L24">面对令人眼花缭乱的浮躁风潮</text><text for="L25">我可不能就此败下阵来</text><text for="L26">分明没那份闲暇 却已疲惫不堪</text><text for="L27">畅快饮下 喉间发出诱人的声响</text><text for="L28">贪求着得不到的东西 又为何在哭泣？</text><text for="L29">好啦 已经全都不要紧了</text><text for="L30">也是时候原谅自己了 挥手告别吧</text><text for="L31">任性起伏波澜不定的情绪</text><text for="L32">起起落落 跌宕沉浮</text><text for="L33">在这之中 究竟哪一个才是真实？</text><text for="L34">你心里其实早就清楚 对吧？</text><text for="L35">甚至根本无需再去追问</text><text for="L36">说着要与这样的自己相伴一生</text><text for="L37">一直一直温柔疼惜下去</text><text for="L38">对明天其实没抱什么希望</text><text for="L39">即便如此 我依然以自己的方式爱着这个世界</text><text for="L40">那些还未完成的桩桩件件</text><text for="L41">我依然一件都不忍心抛下</text><text for="L42">尽是些无法轻言放弃的事</text><text for="L43">重要的东西必须加倍珍惜</text><text for="L44">我要对那一天的自己放声高歌</text><text for="L45">滑落的泪滴绝不会背叛自己</text><text for="L46">尽是些绝不能忘却的事</text><text for="L47">无论身处困顿还是安康</text><text for="L48">每当起风时总会涌上心头</text><text for="L49">铭刻于心 吞下所有 坚定前行</text><text for="L50">一直 一直 直到永远</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Haruko Nagaya</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn" xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"><text for="L1"><span begin="0:01.096" end="0:01.596">wasu</span><span begin="0:01.596" end="0:01.796">re</span><span begin="0:01.796" end="0:02.076">cha </span><span begin="0:02.076" end="0:02.256">i</span><span begin="0:02.256" end="0:02.446">ke</span><span begin="0:02.446" end="0:02.786">na</span><span begin="0:02.786" end="0:03.176">i ko</span><span begin="0:03.176" end="0:03.486">to </span><span begin="0:03.686" end="0:03.816">ba</span><span begin="0:03.816" end="0:04.186">ka</span><span begin="0:04.186" end="0:04.326">ri </span><span begin="0:04.326" end="0:04.646">da</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="0:04.836" end="0:05.096">ya</span><span begin="0:05.096" end="0:05.366">me</span><span begin="0:05.366" end="0:05.566">ru </span><span begin="0:05.566" end="0:05.736">hi </span><span begin="0:05.736" end="0:06.016">mo </span><span begin="0:06.016" end="0:06.456">suko</span><span begin="0:06.456" end="0:06.916">ya</span><span begin="0:06.916" end="0:07.146">ka </span><span begin="0:07.146" end="0:07.466">na</span><span begin="0:07.466" end="0:07.606">ru </span><span begin="0:07.606" end="0:07.876">hi </span><span begin="0:07.876" end="0:08.026">de</span><span begin="0:08.026" end="0:08.366">mo</span></text><text for="L3